Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:02.94,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Afternoon, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:06.90,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Tomorrow starts your long awaited summer vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:09.66,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Those of you who are going to the ocean, mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:12.37,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,rivers, valleys, and PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.33,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,make sure to fully enjoy your youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:19.03,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,and deepen your friendships!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:20.79,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:23.50,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Remember to do your homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:26.97,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You'd better not forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:29.97,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,That's all. Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.85,0:00:34.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's summer vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:36.39,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's have lots of fun this summer, Nao!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:38.64,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,We definitely will! {Yeah, let's do it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.65,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,And I can even go to PriPara with you this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:42.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:44.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll go to PriPara, and the pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.27,0:00:47.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,and PriPara, and the pool, and PriPara, and the pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:49.78,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Um... What about our homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.78,0:00:51.32,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Miss Midorikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.87,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Even though you're starting summer vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:57.50,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,we'll be continuing with the \NPrincess lessons every day as per usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:00:59.29,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Give it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:02.25,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari sure is fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:40.14,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A Date with Prince and the Goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:44.06,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}And a un, deux, trois. {people will understand, surely}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:45.85,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.81,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:49.77,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:52.07,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:54.74,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Elegant and beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:57.24,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,The world is my oyster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:59.20,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I'll rise to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:02.75,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,A dazzling, gorgeous and noble princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:06.83,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,And to do that requires heart, technique, and physique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:10.29,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You must wholeheartedly become a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:15.30,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,It seems you still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:20.68,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,However, compared to when you started,\N you've made a lot of progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:23.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Ms. Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:27.48,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I'm being{orig: going to be} tough on you since \NI want you to win the Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:29.69,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Grand Prix?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:34.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,With whom should I form a five person team, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:38.16,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I'm sure Prince Hibiki is figuring that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:41.62,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Anyway, that is all for today's lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:45.12,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,After this, you should practice what we've worked on today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:48.58,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:51.88,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Now then, have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:55.30,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:01.35,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We're here to determine the additional\N two members who will join us...{This meeting is to decide on our five person team so that we can secure...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.81,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,in the Summer Dream Idol Grand Prix-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:06.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,First, we've already agreed on Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:08.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We haven't asked her yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:10.44,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Laala, we'll leave that to you-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:14.03,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It seems you're the one who talks to her the most-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:15.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:17.40,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The other could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:18.82,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:18.82,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,...Nanami!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I don't think so-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:24.49,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Iroha already turned us down...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:26.75,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:30.25,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,The one we put on a passionate concert with that one time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.63,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Didn't she join with New & Mew and that other girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:36.71,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,They're already of one mind and body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:40.26,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I guess this time we'll try leaving it to our manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:41.76,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.68,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We've already decided on Fuwari, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:46.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Go find someone for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:49.64,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Someone who is super skilled who'll join us and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:51.35,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:54.77,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You say that, but with how much I've been\N tending to Dressing Pafé recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:57.82,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I've had no motivation to go out scouting-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:05:01.95,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's a manager's job to scout others-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:05.28,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,But to find someone who can win...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:08.37,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to bring \Nsomeone in from outside PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:11.08,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Whoa, we can do something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:13.17,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Impossible-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:16.71,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,As I'm sure you can tell, \NI don't have that many connections-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,3,0,0,0,,{groan}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.80,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:27.77,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Elegant and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:30.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The world is my oyster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I will rise to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:37.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,And become a radiant, gorgeous, and noble princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:41.61,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,That's wonderful-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:45.74,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko saw a dazzling princess-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:50.58,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Compared to Fuwari, Toriko is a plain, worthless, overshadowed piece of rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.29,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Hey, Toriko,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:56.29,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder what "rise to the top" actually means.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:59.96,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It means that everyone else is below you-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:03.01,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,You'd be a princess that will stand at the top-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:07.31,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Compared to that, Toriko is a plain,\N worthless, overshadowed piece of rubbish...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:10.22,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Isn't that lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.02,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:15.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be lonely to stand above everyone else?{Wouldn't I be alone if I stood above everyone else?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.61,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to be with everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:24.82,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,But Fuwari, you wouldn't be a princess-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:35.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My prince's Making Drama is truly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:38.84,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I sparkle and shine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:42.76,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But I'm not understanding it any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.80,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's the right fit for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:47.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:52.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wait, did you just speak like a human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:55.81,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Laala, why are you at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:07:00.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I came because I wanted to ask you to join our Dream Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:02.28,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Ah! Why are you here, Laala?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:04.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:05.49,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You're trying to get the jump on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:10.37,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's like I keep saying, Fuwari's joining Dressing Pafé, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:14.79,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?! But I want her to join SoLaMi Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.58,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:20.84,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I mean, having the princess candidate \Njoin your team would be a cheap way to win.{it'd be pretty cheap of you to win by having the princess candidate join your team.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:21.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Same goes to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:23.88,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh, we're totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:25.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,How are you different?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:29.18,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can even become the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:29.89,Default,Lathy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:36.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So Shikyouin gave you a Making Drama as a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:37.81,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:40.48,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,However, it's not going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:46.32,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Something like the "world is my oyster" \Ndoesn't really seem like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.49,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:52.37,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Well, "the world is my oyster" \Nis something I'm max down with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:55.33,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I do have the qualities of a princess, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:08:00.50,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Maybe someone more suitable like\N Dorothy should be the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:02.29,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.84,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Then let's go talk to Shikyouin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I don't think that's what she meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:15.18,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,All right, Hibiki, give us a sharp gaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.10,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's great. Show us some more emotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.77,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Yes, that'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:22.27,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:23.82,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:27.57,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,All right. Thank you, everyone. \NWe're done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.57,0:08:28.82,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:30.66,Default,Photo,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:31.62,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:34.79,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:36.45,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:48.17,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The world is my oyster....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.19,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:05.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.90,0:09:08.19,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm so busy and can't see you more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:14.37,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Could these roses possibly be\N enough to beg your forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:16.37,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:21.83,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:26.30,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Your lack of sentence-enders cleanses the heart. {can't remember what actually made it to release last time}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.30,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The one who knows not of uncleanliness,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.34,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,with a heart of pure white,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.05,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and is the ideal princess candidate,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:35.76,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,would you go on a date with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:46.23,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.07,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:53.24,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Let's perform the Making Drama I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:54.41,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:01.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Is this really me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:08.50,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,A beautiful dress befitting of a beautiful princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:10.21,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And to top it off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:12.13,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:19.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:23.52,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:26.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bon appétit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:33.57,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This is the spoon you use for dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.24,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:37.99,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:39.20,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:43.66,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Your smile is like the summer sun, \Nsparkling through the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.13,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:51.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You're so radiant, even the lobster is blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:51.88,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:58.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Beautiful girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:01.18,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,May I have this dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.06,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:07.86,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,They're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:08.98,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,Stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:14.36,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This step...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.03,0:11:16.07,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This sense of rhythm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:18.28,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Look how good you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:23.00,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:26.50,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}really be?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:32.30,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I've been lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:35.67,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As I am known as a prince in this glamorous world,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:38.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,all the women who approach me are but mere shams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:43.56,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Ah, how love's tender touch has escaped my grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:45.98,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As have the roses of passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:48.40,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,But I have found them at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:55.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Take my hand and become the true princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:11.04,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to your concert tomorrow, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:14.88,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Show me the you who has been dyed in my colour. {this sentence bugs me, but i have no idea how else to phrase it... it's not too bad though - dawn}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:16.38,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:33.02,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Keep them balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.69,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Stand up straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:35.53,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.53,0:12:38.24,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You're doing wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:46.12,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Do your feet hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.50,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You're not even going to take them off during your break?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.08,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:53.96,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A princess must always wear elegant footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:13:00.93,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Elegant and beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:03.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world is my oyster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:06.14,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will rise above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:11.56,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Illuminate the world, gorgeous noble princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:15.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The world is my oyster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:23.45,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wholeheartedly become a princess.{consistency with hell if I remember when}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:26.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world is my oyster...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:29.29,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That isn't wholehearted...{from my heart}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:35.38,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Someone tell me what I should do!{What should I do? Someone tell me!}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:37.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.51,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Laala?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:41.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:44.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Um... What should I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:50.31,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I came here to become a princess, yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:54.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Laala, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:56.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:58.98,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Th-That's pretty difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:02.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:03.82,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:08.62,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Well, if you're not sure what to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:10.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,why don't you blow it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:12.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Blow it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.21,0:14:13.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:16.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,If you put everything into exercising,{By putting everything into moving your body,}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:18.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,and just concentrate on having fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:22.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,eventually you'll be like \N"Huh? What was I even worried about?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:24.64,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That sounds wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:28.43,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hey! Laala's trying to get the jump on us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.10,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorothy, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dressing Pafé!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:35.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's all go play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:36.36,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:38.27,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you suddenly?{What are you talking about all of a sudden?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:42.49,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,With the Summer Dream so close, we don't have the ti—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:48.45,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,The Daruma has fallen over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:57.38,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Laala has fallen over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:59.34,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Max capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:59.34,Default,Lawana,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:04.80,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Mirei has fallen over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:06.26,Default,Lawana,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:08.26,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Gotcha...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:09.93,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You moved, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.10,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,No I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:11.81,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You did too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:12.85,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:14.98,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:13.60,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:14.98,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:18.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:27.66,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Leona, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.49,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you want to go that way, Dorothy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:31.20,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Fuwari, let's go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:32.74,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:35.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Look out! I'm gonna catch you!
Comment: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.54,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Comment: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:38.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Grr! {too childish? grr is fine}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:39.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:42.55,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:45.05,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:55.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Now you're it, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:57.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:04.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I take you off for a little, shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{sound of effort}{hahahaha great onomatopoeia}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:14.33,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:17.87,Default,4,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:19.58,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:23.46,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:25.42,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:28.13,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,She's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:32.43,Default,Doona,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:33.60,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:35.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:36.31,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.99,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You all came?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:48.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Let's race!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{sound of effort}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{sound of effort}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:20.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We climbed a tree together the first time I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:21.69,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:25.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I've always thought that...
