Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:39.83,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're far more fascinating now than when we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:42.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\1}Is that true?
